flowchart LR
    subgraph CI [Standard CI Gates]
        Gate[PR Gatekeeper]
        Lint[Linters]
        Build[Build Verification]
        Test[Coverage < 80%]
        Sec[CodeQL / GHAS]
        Doc[Doc Drift]
    end

    subgraph GHAW [gh-aw Agentic Remediation Loops]
        direction TB
        A1[Agent: Enrich / Fix PR Metadata]
        A2[Agent: Auto-fix Formatting]
        A4[Agent: Generate Missing Unit Tests]
        A3[Agent / Copilot Autofix: Patch Vulns]
        A5[Agent: Generate / Update Docs]
    end

    Gate -->|Fail| A1 -->|Update PR| CI
    Lint -->|Fail| A2 -->|Commit Fix| CI
    Build -->|Fail| CI
    Test -->|Fail| A4 -->|Stacked PR| CI
    Sec  -->|Alert| A3 -->|Stacked PR| CI
    Doc  -->|Fail| A5 -->|Stacked PR| CI

    CI -->|All Pass| Review[AI & Human Review]
